    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Positive</td><td>Tired; weight down 1.2 kg; no fever</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No nausea, vomiting, or diarrhea now</td></tr><tr><td>Integumentary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No injection-site redness or abscess</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Positive</td><td>Low mood, poor sleep, and shame after the return to use; no thoughts of suicide or self-harm</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>4 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

